## 📋 Upgrade & Migration Guide
1. Ensure configuration environment variables (`JWT_SECRET`, `ENCRYPTION_KEY`, `DB_PATH`) are set.
2. Launch service binary; SQLite database schema and administrator credentials migrate automatically.
3. Access web interface and verify project source connectivity.

